{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02963",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 6.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.76,
      "end_seconds": 10.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.22,
      "end_seconds": 14.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Well, I've been having vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.87,
      "end_seconds": 19.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.83,
      "end_seconds": 22.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.16,
      "end_seconds": 27.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.09,
      "end_seconds": 30.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.37,
      "end_seconds": 33.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.84,
      "end_seconds": 48.84,
      "duration_seconds": 13.0,
      "text": "It comes and goes. As for bone pain, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.63,
      "end_seconds": 52.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Any being very confused as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.69,
      "end_seconds": 55.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Yes, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.39,
      "end_seconds": 66.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Have you had vomiting before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.11,
      "end_seconds": 73.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.85,
      "end_seconds": 94.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.95,
      "end_seconds": 100.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Yeah, it's sumatriptan, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.16,
      "end_seconds": 104.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.94,
      "end_seconds": 109.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.47,
      "end_seconds": 113.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.03,
      "end_seconds": 121.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Just my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.2,
      "end_seconds": 127.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Alright, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.35,
      "end_seconds": 134.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Yes, migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.78,
      "end_seconds": 139.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.27,
      "end_seconds": 143.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.37,
      "end_seconds": 145.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Right, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.31,
      "end_seconds": 148.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.74,
      "end_seconds": 152.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.19,
      "end_seconds": 156.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.46,
      "end_seconds": 158.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.89,
      "end_seconds": 163.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.62,
      "end_seconds": 169.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.64,
      "end_seconds": 174.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.75,
      "end_seconds": 194.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Did you get fever, chest pain or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.64,
      "end_seconds": 200.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, chest pain or fall, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.85,
      "end_seconds": 205.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.31,
      "end_seconds": 211.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.91,
      "end_seconds": 214.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.12,
      "end_seconds": 216.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 230.97,
      "end_seconds": 246.93,
      "duration_seconds": 15.96,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temp 36.7 degrees, height 171 centimetres. Pulse is 106 beats a minute, BP is 93 over 63, respiratory rate 16, BMI works out to 18.1, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, weight 53 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.19,
      "end_seconds": 249.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.93,
      "end_seconds": 255.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.31,
      "end_seconds": 257.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.04,
      "end_seconds": 260.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.2,
      "end_seconds": 274.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "You are dehydrated and drowsy with a slow, odd rhythm on the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.14,
      "end_seconds": 297.53,
      "duration_seconds": 18.39,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Let me tell you where I've got to. I'd lean towards a high calcium emergency. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be a kidney failure, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.32,
      "end_seconds": 300.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.21,
      "end_seconds": 332.84,
      "duration_seconds": 31.63,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a high calcium emergency is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get an ECG, for hypercalcaemia. I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for confusion and polyuria. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'll start you on sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour, single dose. That should help with dehydration. You need hospital fluids and treatment now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.25,
      "end_seconds": 345.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.97,
      "end_seconds": 348.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.79,
      "end_seconds": 351.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Come back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.02,
      "end_seconds": 353.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.43,
      "end_seconds": 358.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.01,
      "end_seconds": 364.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}